	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you’ve long since learned that quick actions can save lives. Choose between the following options:</p><p><strong>Reach for the Skies:</strong> If a creature readies a weapon to shoot at you or an ally, you can use your reaction to make an attack on the creature. On a successful hit, you deal damage normally and the target must make a Constitution save or drop the weapon.</p><p><strong>Lowdown Dirty Backshooter:</strong> If a creature ends its movement further away from you than where it began, you can use a reaction to make a firearm attack against them.</p>",
